  "description": "The two celestial beings, Centi and Auri tell a story about how the world of Aserith started to crumble. They created guardians called Gydens to protect the humans from monsters. But the humans started mistreating the Gyden's kindness and purpose on their world, thus created a spark that lead to war. Now the two celestials reunited 5 people to gather shards of a star that could grant a wish and save the world.\n\n- Webtoons",
